Beyond weddings, the venue hosts corporate functions such as conferences, business dinners and year-end events, as well as private functions including birthdays, anniversaries, reunions and retirement send-offs, each with access to a dedicated entrance, bar and restrooms rather than shared facilities. Garden space fitted with sound equipment also supports picnics and outdoor gatherings. Based in Montana Gardens, Ultimate Sky suits anyone planning a wedding, private celebration or corporate event who wants a single venue handling both the function space and overnight accommodation.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'http://www.ultimatesky.co.za/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'ultimate-sky-montana-gardens' AND description = 'Ultimate Sky is an events venue in Montana accommodating up to 500 guests, hosting weddings, receptions, birthdays and conferences, with state-of-the-art audio-visual facilities and conference spaces for 130 to 450 attendees.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
  AND owner_user_id IS NULL AND COALESCE(subscription_tier, 0) = 0 AND COALESCE(origin, '') != 'owner_submitted'
  AND status = 'published' AND closed_at IS NULL AND is_test = 0
